   141	### 1.5 The two facts about `A_14` that do the work
   142	
   143	Fix the local analytic normal form of the germ: `(ξ,η) = (s^{15}, s²)` (equation
   144	`ξ² = η^{15}`), tangent line `{ξ=0}`.
   145	
   146	**(F1) Maximal smooth contact is 15.** Let `S` be any smooth germ at `Q_∞`, `ℓ` its
