   154	the value `15` occurring only when `β = 0` and `c_{0j} = 0` for `j ≤ 7`. No cancellation
   155	can raise it: the only monomial of order `15` is `αξ` itself (`15i+2j=15 ⟹ (i,j)=(1,0)`).
