   160	```text
   161	   0 , 2 , 4 , 6 , 8 , 12       (all distinct;  10 is absent) .                (1.2)
   162	```
   163	
   164	Distinctness means **no cancellation between basis terms**, so for any conic
   165	`a = c_1 + c_2v + c_3v² + c_4w + c_5vw + c_6w²`,
