                                  1. Preliminary
  In this section, we recall the theory of triple covers based on Miranda’s work [8]
and some facts for locally free sheaves of rank 2 on P2 .

1.1. Triple covers. See [3], [8] and [14] for details and proofs. Let Y be a non-
