1.1.2. Given a locally free sheaf E of rank two on Y, the OY -algebra structures of
A = OY ⊕ E giving triple covers with Tπ = E are in one-to-one correspondence with
OY -linear maps Φ : S 3 E → det E ([8, Theorem 3.6]).

