+| `TRIPLE-COVER` | **NO** if it means a connected simply-branched degree-three/\(S_3\) cover of \(\mathbf A^2\) with branch \(D_j\). This needs the whole NO-TORUS + INF + descent + Shirane chain, not “step 5 alone.” |
